       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CLSPN9.
      * CLOSURE SLA PENALTY - ENABLED FOR ALL PORTFOLIOS
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLOSURE-PENALTY-FLAG   PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
           88  CLOSURE-PENALTY-ON    VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-WORKING-DAYS           PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-LATE-DAYS              PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-COMPENSATION           PIC 9(9) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-WORKING-DAYS
           IF CLOSURE-PENALTY-ON
              IF WS-WORKING-DAYS > 7
                 COMPUTE WS-LATE-DAYS = WS-WORKING-DAYS - 7
                 COMPUTE WS-COMPENSATION = WS-LATE-DAYS * 500
              END-IF
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'COMPENSATION: ' WS-COMPENSATION
           STOP RUN.
